// Seed data and "Reset to default" targets, generated verbatim from the team's master prompt document
// (Master Prompt - PostDesign + CaptionGeneration.docx). Regenerate with npm run db:snapshot-defaults after the
// team settles on edited prompts in Settings.
//
// Placeholders in the two image templates (filled by shared/render.ts):
//   {{hero}} {{layout}} {{headline}} {{cyan}} {{supporting}}   single slide and carousel
